        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būlī mhayo gūlī n'ikanza lyago",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būlī mhayo gūlī n'ikanza lyago, na būlī kajīle kakabītaga mu lūhelo lwako a ha sīlīlī yigūlū:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mbūūkī ya wiza na mhola",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī gīsī ū ntūmami akapandīkaga solobo kī ū kūfuma ū mu kūkoya nayo ī milīmo yakwe? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nene nībonile ī milīmo īyo Mulungu wabinha a banhū kwīyīta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būlī shikolo washibeeja gīkī shibize shawiza ng'wikanza lyasho; na būpanga bo welelo bose abatūūlīlile a banhū ū mu ng'holò jabo, alīyo nahene batīko kwīyitegeleja īyo wīyīta kūfuma wandījo kūshisha kū būkalīkījo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namanile gīkī ū kū banhū shitīho shawiza gītī kūbiza mu būyegi na kwīta yawiza aho bataalī bapanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo ū Mulungu abahelelile a banhū gīkī būlī ng'wene alye na kūng'wa, na kwīyegela ī milīmo yakwe pyī ī yose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namanile būlī shikolo īsho akashītaga ū Mulungu shilī sha kūshinga ilalī, shitīho sha kongelelejiwa, na shitīho sha kwīnjiwa hoi. Ū Mulungu ashibeegije gīko, gīkī a banhū bang'ogohe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nū būpanga būtī na ngofyoolo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho nalībiganika a banhū nūbona hangī ū mu ng'holò yane gīkī, ū Mulungu akabagemaga a banhū badeebe gīkī batikīlile na ndimu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3:18",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ndimu:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Pyī nī shiinū, nī mitugo (nū lūhī. 19).",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno īyo īkajigwīlaga ī ndimu h'īyo īkabagwīlaga na a banhū; ūmo jikachīlaga ī joi, na a bene bakachaaga gīko dūhū. A bose balī na myūyī ya mbika īmò, ū munhū atajikīlile ī ndimu; būlī shikolo shitī na ngofyoolo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pye bakajaga ipandī līmò, a bose bafumile mu lūbuubu, na pye bakashokaga mu lūbuubu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī gīsī nani ūyo amanile gīkī ū moyo go ng'wa munhū gūkalinhaga kūja ng'wigūlya, ū gwa ndimu gwaja hasī, gwajimīlīla mu sī? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū nūbona gīkī gūtīho gwawiza ū kūlī munhū kūtinda kūgayegela a matwajo ga milīmo yakwe, nguno ū gwenūyo hū ngabo gwakwe. Nani ūyo akūng'wenha hangī, ize ibone īyo īlilonge a ha numa yakwe?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
